.tool manage_billing
.maxbytes 4096
.param view enum(overview, plans, topup) One of overview, plans, topup. Do not provide amounts.
.param note string? A short note shown next to the control.
.param filter object? Narrow the usage shown.
.param filter.since string ISO date to count usage from.
.param filter.models []string? Model slugs to include.
.param items []object? Line items.
.param items.sku string The SKU.
.param items.qty int How many.
.param extra any? Free-form passthrough.

Show an inline billing control with authoritative usage, plans, or top-up settings.
This tool only reads and prepares a control: the user must click and `consent`.

.title System
You are <!name>.
